msgstr "Du muttst tominnst een gellen Proxy-Ümgevenvariabel angeven."

#: settings/kio/kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:130 settings/kio/kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:292
msgid ""
"<qt>Make sure you entered the actual environment variable name rather than "
